==Trivia==
*The track was remixed into {{RSL|Amascut's Vision}} - which is also composed by Mod Surma - for the conclusion of the Desert Quest series in ''RuneScape 3''.
*A cover of ''Amascut's Promise'' was made available to play in mobile rhythm game Beatstar as part of a collaboration.{{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/game-jam-charges-qol?oldschool=1|title=Game Jam: Charges QoL|newsdate=5 March 2025}}

